module_summary:
Explicit schema-1/2 compatibility projection from one owned snapshot.

Normal CLI recording never enters this module. Snapshotting precedes all I/O;
reset/close or a failed publication cannot change the bytes being exported.

Declared mid-drive data and pedelec permission.

Bosch values were recalled from memory without a web lookup, as requested;
they are unverified approximations, including the linear eMTB support law.

A4: acknowledgement, immutable outputs, reset/close, and fatal prefixes.

Fatal probes run in subprocesses under the existing selected-artifact loader;
no process-global MuJoCo failure is injected into the pytest worker.
